name graphpaper
category Package
revision 63116
shortdesc A LaTeX class to generate several types of graph papers
longdesc Graphpaper is a LaTeX document class which allows to print
longdesc several types of graph papers: bilinear (millimeter paper),
longdesc semilogarithmic, bilogarithmic, polar, log-polar, Smith charts.
longdesc It is based on the picture environment and its extensions.
